14862	SENT-PUL-0022	fuc	nganndumi ko fatti moritani : Moritani leydi tawaandi e daande maayo Atlantik Afrik, ko ndi jokkorgal geɗe leydi e pinal hakkunde diiwaan Magrib worgo Afrik e nokku ɓurɗo hirnaange Afrik worgo Saharaa. Ko nokku gonɗo hakkunde yimɓe aarabeeɓe-amazigh en (berbeer en) e Afrik worgo e leƴƴi Afrik fuɗnaange Tropic Cancer, anndiraaɗo Sudaan. Ko ɓuri heewde e leydi Moritani ina jeyaa e jeereende Saharaa, e nder tariya, feccere mawnde e yimɓe mum ko hoɗɓe e nokkuuji ɗii, haa yooro e kitaale 1970 yani e diiwaan hee. Leydi ndii ina heewi ngalu keewngu, ina heen kadi keɓe mawɗe, ko wayi no njamndi mboɗeeri, njamndi mboɗeeri, e jippunde, ɗe kuutortee ko no feewi, kam e won e geɗe petroŋ. Moritani ko leydi Farayse e nder feccere adannde e teeminannde 20siire, heɓi jeytaare mum ñalnde 28 noowammbar 1960. Lislaam ko diine laawɗuɗo, kono doosgal leydi ina ɗaɓɓi ndimaagu ɓernde e ndimaagu diine. Ko Arab woni ɗemngal laawɗungal, Fula, Soninke, e Wolof nganndaa ko ɗemɗe ngenndiije. Laamorgo leydi ndii, hono Nouakchott, woni ko e bannge worgo-fuɗnaange leydi ndii.				Mauritanian Context	paragraph	pulaar_mauritania_sentences.csv		f	2026-11-07 16:42:09.64919+00
