14857	SENT-PUL-0017	fuc	Jaɓɓungal e gollorɗe Moritani ina ceerti e jillondiral geɗe aadaaji e geɗe jamaanu. E nder laddeeji, yah-ngartaa e daabaaji pack ko wayi no gelooɗi, e pucci ina heddii e nafoore. Kono tan, yah-ngartaa laabi ina ɓeydoo heewde ngam jokkondirde gure e diiwanuuji. Leydi ndii ina jogii caɗeele teeŋtuɗe e mahngo laabi sabu mbayliigu nguu, e ilam ɗam, e kaaƴe ɓutte. Ɗee caɗeele fof e wayde noon, won laabi teeŋtuɗi ina ngolloo hitaande kala, ko wayi no laawol mawngol jokkondirngol Rosso e Tindouf, Alseri, rewrude e Nuwaas, Akjoujt, Atar, Fdérik, e Bîr Mogreïn. Ko ina tolnoo e tataɓal laabi Moritani ko pawaaɗi. Yaakaare Moritani , timminaande e hitaande 1982, ina jokkondiri e Nuwaksot e bannge hirnaange leydi ndii rewrude e Kaédi, Kiffa, ʿAyoun el-ʿAtrous, e Néma. Yanti heen, laawol mawngol hakkunde worgo-fuɗnaange jokkondirngol e Nuwaasoot e Nuwaadhibou timminaama e hitaande 2004. Moritani ina jogii kadi laawol laana njoorndi jokkondirngol e nokkuuji njulaagu Zouérate, Guelb El Rheïn, e Mhaoudat e porto to Nuwaadhibou, hay so tawii noon laawol laana njoorndi ina famɗi. Laanaaji diwooje hakkunde leyɗeele ina tawee e Nuwaaksot, Aeroport hakkunde leyɗeele Nuwaaksot-Oumtounsy ko laamorgo diwooje hakkunde leyɗeele gollortoongo Nuwaksot, laamorgo leydi Moritani. O woni ko 25 kiloomeeteer to fuɗnaange wuro ngoo. Aeroport oo udditaa ko e lewru suwee 2016 ngam lomtaade Aeroport hakkunde leyɗeele Nouakchott. Sektora telefoŋaaji yiytii ɓeydagol jaawngol, haa teeŋti noon e sarwisaaji celluka moɓtooji, tawi abonmaaji telefoŋaaji ina usta. Enternet ina woodi e fotde diiwanuuji keewɗi yimɓe				Mauritanian Context	paragraph	pulaar_mauritania_sentences.csv		f	2026-11-07 16:42:09.649175+00
